### Review-fix self-review

- Confirmed `_build_verification_scope` has no dependency on baseline attempt
  files and only ranks active authenticated tradable membership.
- Confirmed the parity path retained the independently attested selected
  universe with bundle and benchmark attestation; round 2 restored its exact
  equality binding to the independently derived readiness scope.
- Confirmed evaluator and holdout panels are subsets of full tradables, market
  references remain disjoint, and market context is exactly their union.

## Review fix round 2

- Restored the fail-closed equality binding between the parity reference's
  selected universe and the independently derived verification-scope symbols
  authenticated in readiness.  A stale parity artifact with the former
  baseline-activity-derived panel now fails rather than changing the replay
  panel silently.
- Added the matching canonical selected-universe hash check to hidden holdout
  setup.  Live evaluation already performs this check, so discovery and hidden
  replay now both use the same universe identity as the subset fold manifest.

